.TH OWASP 7 "2026-11-15" "OWASP Top 10:2025" "Software Weakness Reference"
.SH NAME
owasp \- OWASP Top 10:2025 index (CWE overlay)
.SH DESCRIPTION
The OWASP Top 10:2025 lists ten web\-application risk \fBcategories\fR. Each category is a bundle of CWEs, not a single weakness. These pages map each category onto the \fBcwe\-*\fR(7) set. They do not duplicate examples.
.PP
This is not the OWASP API, LLM, or Agentic Top 10.
